    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/d58c6d3511b156168bbe5699ea802404.avif?t=1745993426\" width=616 height=187 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SERVE YOUR GUEST</h2>Step into the shoes of a night janitor, shrouded in secrets and danger.<br><br>The Cope is a Survival Horror Point and Click game. Your night shift guest service job as a janitor will start with you getting entangled in a series of strange stories in The Cope mansion, with unknown rules and fear.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/05c9872e21d5835069a471b1358f2cf1.poster.avif?t=1745993426\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/05c9872e21d5835069a471b1358f2cf1.webm?t=1745993426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/05c9872e21d5835069a471b1358f2cf1.mp4?t=1745993426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/ae434810c8de38d7354fef2cbd6bd150.avif?t=1745993426\" width=616 height=87 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE NIGHT</h2>The Cope plunges you into a janitor's worst nightmare. Trapped in a mansion of bizarre events, your night shift becomes a test of survival. Confront unsettling mysteries by the unknown events approaching you when off guard.<br>Prepare for a night of terror at The Cope. Brace yourself, Maintain your Sanity, or face the consequences. As your sanity dwindles, the line between reality and madness blurs, and the darkness that lurks within the mansion will consume you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/1e827fadb39533f717c3101536441349.poster.avif?t=1745993426\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/1e827fadb39533f717c3101536441349.webm?t=1745993426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/1e827fadb39533f717c3101536441349.mp4?t=1745993426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERFORM YOUR TASKS</h2>Engage in a diverse range of mini-games that test your cleaning or fixing skills and keep you on the edge of your seat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/a75f4dc5f1fd4ff983965b6d06f61d0e.poster.avif?t=1745993426\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/a75f4dc5f1fd4ff983965b6d06f61d0e.webm?t=1745993426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/a75f4dc5f1fd4ff983965b6d06f61d0e.mp4?t=1745993426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OBEY THE RULES</h2>obey posted on each guest's door to avoid their wrath.Tread carefully and avoid making mistakes that could cost you your life.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/27b9ab51ad44381d4525fea2e31f5fd7.poster.avif?t=1745993426\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/27b9ab51ad44381d4525fea2e31f5fd7.webm?t=1745993426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/27b9ab51ad44381d4525fea2e31f5fd7.mp4?t=1745993426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENDLESS DARKNESS</h2>When You Fall, tasks, Levels, and Rules are Randomized. Each playthrough presents a unique challenge, ensuring that no two experiences are the same.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/cdd6850cf780d6af2ca808023db88720.poster.avif?t=1745993426\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/cdd6850cf780d6af2ca808023db88720.webm?t=1745993426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/cdd6850cf780d6af2ca808023db88720.mp4?t=1745993426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNRAVELING FEAR</h2>Piece together the fragments of the mansion's chilling history to uncover the truth behind The Cope by Animation Cutscene and Collectible items around the mansion.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/bf83fe28e2ae5b165195adbcbfa28d5a.poster.avif?t=1745993426\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/bf83fe28e2ae5b165195adbcbfa28d5a.webm?t=1745993426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/bf83fe28e2ae5b165195adbcbfa28d5a.mp4?t=1745993426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BONE CHILLING ASTHETICS</h2>Thrilled by the atmosphere of the world setting inspired by HP.Lovecraft &amp; Rule's of Horror story. Enhanced with 2D hand-drawn style art and animation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/2033a3cbcae1288595b7cd30beaedc70.poster.avif?t=1745993426\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/2033a3cbcae1288595b7cd30beaedc70.webm?t=1745993426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/2033a3cbcae1288595b7cd30beaedc70.mp4?t=1745993426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Are you ready to face the fear of the unknown that awaits within The Cope Mansion?</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979860/extras/be9739f9b5db8204e0765c77870505b3.avif?t=1745993426\" width=616 height=87 /></span>",
